ng the hood scoop may weaken, allowing the hood scoop to detach from the vehicle.","consequence":"If the hood scoop detaches, it may become a road hazard, increasing the risk of a crash.","remedy":"SET will notify owners, and dealers will mechanically fasten the scoop to the hood, free of charge.  The recall began on September 1, 2017.  Owners may contact SET customer service at 1-954-429-2000.  SET's number for this recall is SET17B.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":3547,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=17V425000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":12,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2012","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2011","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"},{"year":"2011","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2012","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"},{"year":"2013","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"},{"year":"2015","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"},{"year":"2015","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2013","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"},{"year":"2016","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2016","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"14V828000","received":"2014-12-30","manufacturer":"Southeast Toyota Distributors, LLC","component":"EQUIPMENT","summary":"Southeast Toyota Distributors, LLC (SET) is recalling certain model year 2014-2015 Toyota 4Runner, Tacoma, FJ Cruiser, Land Cruiser, RAV4, Scion FRS, and XB vehicles.  The affected vehicles may have accessories installed by SET, such as running boards or other items, that were incorrectly installed.  The accessory attaching fasteners were not tightened with the proper torque, possibly causing the accessory to detach from the vehicle.","consequence":"Accessories that detach from a vehicle may result in a vehicle crash and/or personal injury.","remedy":"SET will notify owners, and dealers will inspect and tighten the affected bolts, free of charge. The recall began February 23, 2015. Owners may contact SET customer service at 1-866-405-4226. SET's number for this recall is SET-14B.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":3958,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=14V828000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":14,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"LAND CRUISER"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"RAV4"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"},{"year":"2015","make":"TOYOTA","model":"LAND CRUISER"},{"year":"2015","make":"TOYOTA","model":"RAV4"},{"year":"2014","make":"SCION","model":"XB"},{"year":"2015","make":"SCION","model":"XB"},{"year":"2014","make":"SCION","model":"FR-S"},{"year":"2015","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"},{"year":"2015","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"},{"year":"2015","make":"SCION","model":"FR-S"},{"year":"2015","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"14V475000","received":"2014-08-04","manufacturer":"Toyota Motor Engineering & Manufacturing","component":"EQUIPMENT:OTHER:LABELS","summary":"Toyota Motor Engineering & Manufacturing (Toyota) is recalling certain model year 2008-2014 FJ Cruiser and Tacoma vehicles equipped with accessory wheels and tires installed by Toyota or dealers prior to the vehicle's first sale.  The affected vehicles may list incorrect spare tire size and/or cold tire inflation information on the tire placard.  As such, these vehicles fail to comply with Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standard No. 110, \"Tire Selection and Rims for Passenger Cars.\"","consequence":"If the spare tire is inflated to the incorrect pressure provided on the placard, tire failure may occur while it is being driven on, increasing the risk of a crash.","remedy":"For the involved vehicles, overlay stickers to correct the tire placard will either be mailed to owners or provided to dealers for placement over the incorrect information on the placard.  The recall is expected to begin in September 2014.  Owners may contact Toyota customer service at 1-800-331-4331.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":20000,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=14V475000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":14,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2009","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2009","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"},{"year":"2008","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"},{"year":"2008","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2010","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2010","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"},{"year":"2012","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2011","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"},{"year":"2011","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2012","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"},{"year":"2013","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"},{"year":"2013","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"FJ CRUISER"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"13V557000","received":"2013-11-07","manufacturer":"Toyota Motor Engineering & Manufacturing","component":"ENGINE","summary":"Toyota Motor Engineering & Manufacturing North America (Toyota) is recalling certain model year 2013-2014 Tacoma vehicles manufactured July 1, 2013, through October 11, 2013.  The engines of the affected vehicles contain valve springs that may break over time.","consequence":"If the valve springs break, the engine could fail and stall while the vehicle is being driven, increasing the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Toyota will notify owners, and dealers will replace the valve springs, free of charge.  The recall began on November 27, 2013.  Owners may contact Toyota at 1-800-331-4331.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":3795,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=13V557000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":2,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2013","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2014","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false}]}
